ine-height: 20px;"><h3 data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CB598A0" style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(22, 22, 22); font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Congratulations, your business has been upgraded to Level 3</font></h3></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CB59E90"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CB5A0F0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CB5A5B0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CB5A810" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014899420"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000000F3F1CE0">As a valued Qantas Business Rewards member, we are pleased to advise that&nbsp;<strong data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CB5ABA0">{!Account.Name} has been upgraded to Level 3</strong>, unlocking more rewards, bigger savings, and greater value.<br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000148991E0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014893C10">To find out your benefits as a Level 3 member, visit our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/business-rewards/home.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CB5B060" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); border: 0px;">website</a>.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000019675A00"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000148B1290">For assistance with your account, please call our Service Centre on 13 74 78 between 7am-7pm AEST, Monday to Friday.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001966F5C0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001CB4B600"><em data_liveedit_tagid="00000000146B9060">Qantas Business Rewards</em></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000146BA8D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000146BBBD0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(10